        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ঠোঁট",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঠোঁট — ṭhõṭ — \"a lip\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "শীতে মীরার ঠোঁট শুকনো হয়ে যায়। shīte mīrār ṭhõṭ shukno hôye jāy. In winter Mira's lips get dry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঠোঁট (ṭhõṭ) is listed by CDIAL for Bengali, as a bird's beak, under Sanskrit tuṇḍa, \"beak, snout\" (CDIAL 5853); everyday Bengali uses it for the human lip."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
